8","history":[{"commit":"b2072fc8","summary":"A25: the walk registers with the aggregator (WALK: web e2e rows 4/5/6) and checks that returning (focus) withdraws the notice; rerun at both sizes 43/43, evidence regenerated, the quoted totals updated"},{"commit":"0e1d6f87","summary":"parity: rows 276/322/323 C->A (A25: the Desktop notifications row's states, OS notices shown/closed/clicked to their Session, focus acknowledges + identity resets; makepad API patch D10b) and 321's cites refreshed — A 297 / B 43 / C 21"},{"commit":"c74076e5","summary":"docs(A25): decision D10b — the makepad notification API patch (why, pinned rev 6cf03859, the 10 files, every tree + the APK's cargo-makepad, the app's cfg probe, back to clean upstream, what was verified, the Android device checklist) + the upstream PR draft"},{"commit":"2261199e","summary":"A25: the REAL macOS check — own bundle (dev.octoscode.desktop.a25, tmp/), private octos serve, hidden window: UNUserNotificationCenter reports NotDetermined through the platform layer; the toggle's request makes macOS show its permission prompt (captured via Accessibility, never pressed) and the row reads Enabling…; stopped there for the operator. tools/walk/a25_live_macos.py re-runs the full round trip (real banner + real AX click) once allowed"},{"commit":"0ab521ea","summary":"A25: click walk tools/walk/a25_notifications.py (both sizes 42/42: unavailable/off/on/pending/denied/error/dismissed rows, a finished turn while unfocused notifies once, the click opens its Session, focus acknowledges, a focused window never notifies), UX rows (7 states x 2 sizes, 9) + captures docs/ux/a25; scripts/apply-makepad-patches.sh + the tree-identity test; A3/A7 walks accept the honest Unavailable row"},{"commit":"8c49c441","summary":"wip(A25): attention — the web's tracker, desktop notifications and use-attention natively (OS behind NotifyOs; makepad API via cfg(makepad_notifications)), the Settings row's toggle/Enabling…/Unavailable/alert states, focus